/v1/","context":{"app_id":5026920,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5026920-1846018067937717","game_id":"steam-5026920","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.9.6: Clearer at a Glance","summary":"\"Oh. You found the one I hid. Fine. Take it.\" — The Tower A small update built from two playtests, mostly about one thing: seeing what just happened. ON SCREEN Notifications no longer cover your knight. Announcements are a small card in a corner of the screen (your half in co-op), and the game's cues sit under the top bar. A slimmer XP strip and a shorter HP bar in solo. Chests show what they gave: \"+10 GOLD +HP +XP\". \"LEVEL UP!\" appears over your knight before the card screen opens, and the car","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T03:38:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937717","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5026920-1846018067928187","game_id":"steam-5026920","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.9.5: New Card Screens, Fair Warnings, Meaner Wardens","summary":"\"CHAOS terms accepted. No refunds. I am going to enjoy this.\" — The Tower Everything since 0.9.4 in one update. The three big ones first: new card screens, a game that tells you the move the moment you need it, and Wardens that hit as hard as the difficulty you picked. NEW CARD SCREENS Level-up, the ult pick, the free reward and the market now use new stone-tablet screens. Every card on a screen uses the same text size. On the level-up screen no text is cut off: checked in all 15 languages, at a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T03:14:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928187","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5026920-1845383656375796","game_id":"steam-5026920","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.9.4: The Tower Redecorated","summary":"\"I redecorated. Leave the bodies where they fall. They're part of the look.\" — The Tower Everything since 0.9.1 in one update: a new look for the whole tower, a real door with a stair behind it, an opening cinematic, and a long list of control fixes. A NEW LOOK The tower has been relit from the first floor up. Light travels with you, and the edges of the room fall into real dark. Strong colour belongs only to you, the wardens and attack warnings, so the thing that can hurt you is the thing you s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T23:11:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656375796","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5026920-1844751498226023","game_id":"steam-5026920","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.9.1: The Tower Grew a Body","summary":"\"You came back. Good. I was getting hungry.\" — The Tower The TOWERMOUTH demo has been rebuilt from the inside. Here is what changed. STACK THRESHOLDS Five effect cards now have a threshold. Collect five copies of the same effect and it changes shape: Lightning Rod, Fuse Fist, Blood Web, Thorn Garden or Echo. The more copies you hold, the more often that effect is offered, so a committed build gets there, but not on floor 2. A SLOWER, DEEPER CLIMB Level-ups come less often and cards show smaller ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T21:59:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226023","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5026920-1842846814439983","game_id":"steam-5026920","kind":"announcement","title":"THANK YOU GUYS","summary":"Over 1,000 people have added the TOWERMOUTH demo to their Steam library. For a game nobody had heard of, made by one person, that took a while to believe.The wishlist side is smaller and slower. TOWERMOUTH is at 93 right now — seven away from its first hundred. Small numbers, but they are real people, and I can see every one of them.I build all of it: the tower, the monsters, the loot, the weapons, the two-player couch mode. It is slow, and every floor gets tested until it is actually fun before","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T10:57:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814439983","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5026920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:31Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:31Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5026920":"2026-10-25T22:13:31Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5026920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5043550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:13:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5026920","app_id":5026920,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:17Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d284f58793984ebcbcc4ce343fd276fcf9be8c0a9398c5dffcdf867711e